===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*deyḱ-}}
{{etymon|en|id=Q23622|inh|enm>dixionare>dictionary|afeq|diction>?|-ary>?|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|dixionare}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=dicciọ̄nārīe|pos=n|id=MED11549.5}}</ref> a {{glossary|learned borrowing}} from {{der|en|ML.|dictiōnārium}}, from {{der|en|la|dictiōnārius}}, from {{m|la|dictiō||a speaking}}, from {{m|la|dictus}}, perfect past participle of {{m|la|dīcō|t= to speak}} + {{m|la|-ārium|t=room, place}}. {{surf|en|diction|-ary}}.

